{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.6, [TSON-SCHEMA] §7.2, [TSON-SCHEMA] §8.3 (values by name, proposed as §5.12)"
  description: "A value by name carries no type-ref: the referent's declared type is what the slot judges, so !record in front of the name is refused rather than read as a claim about it."
